    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This section outlines the process and activities involved when implementing a new contract. This is to ensure:",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "supplier(s) have all the information they require to plan user’s migration to the new contract",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Organisations have all the information they require e.g. suppliers’ contact details, information on the goods/services available from the contract",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "continuity of supply",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contract implementation consists of two distinct phases:",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "table",
      "text": "Migration\tthe movement of organisations to a new contract post 'go-live'\nMobilisation\tthe process of moving from contract award to 'go-live', i.e. the point when a user can actually buy from the contract",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {
        "rows": [
          [
            "Migration",
            "the movement of organisations to a new contract post 'go-live'"
          ],
          [
            "Mobilisation",
            "the process of moving from contract award to 'go-live', i.e. the point when a user can actually buy from the contract"
          ]
        ],
        "row_count": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Migration",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "the movement of organisations to a new contract post 'go-live'",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Mobilisation",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "the process of moving from contract award to 'go-live', i.e. the point when a user can actually buy from the contract",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "NB Some steps in the process may be done at the same time.",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This mobilisation process is a guide to help plan activities between contract award and go live. The timescales for each of the stages should be amended to reflect your own specific procurement exercise.",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Consideration must also be given to Planning , Sustainable Procurement and Risk Management throughout this stage of the Procurement Journey.",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The Contract Implementation Plan document listed below will assist you to communicate Framework Agreement / Contracts, Roles and Responsibilities, Framework Agreements / Contract Management Strategy and how customers can engage.",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Any documents you need are listed below",
